<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτειχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>wall off,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> by way of <i>fortifying,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸν Ἰσθμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.36
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> by way of
				<i>blockade,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τοὺς θεοὺς ἀποτειχίσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1576
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐν τῇ ἀκροπόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.130
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.3.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.4.3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.96
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>shut out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτῷ τὴν φυγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					9.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>keep off by fortification,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς καταδρομάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>wall off, separate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη ἀποτειχίζοντα τὴν Ἰταλίαν ἀπό
					τε Ἰλλυρίων καὶ Γαλατῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.72b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>build a partywall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unblock by razing a wall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάσμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					1.3.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>dismantle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκρόπολιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					4.1.88
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
